OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells and light and
OL,7,Fvariable winds bringing the risk of
OL,8,Fsome frost and fog patches come dawn.
OL,9,FEastern counties may turn cloudier
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FOvernight fog dispersing
OL,13,Fthrough the morning. Otherwise a dry
OL,14,Fday with variable amounts of cloud,
OL,15,Fbest of the sunshine across western
OL,16,Fcounties.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMainly
OL,19,Fdry with some brighter spells
OL,20,Fdeveloping. Winds light. Early frost
OL,21,Fand possibly fog patches.
